# UI registry map (FastyGo → shadcn-like)

Shared layer map for FastyGoUI / `fastygo add`. Paths also live in `fastygo.config.mjs` → `registry`.

## Where to look

| Need | Path | Import |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Primitives / atoms** | `internal/kit/ui/<name>` | `.../internal/kit/ui/...` |
| **Atom helpers** | `internal/kit/utils` | `.../internal/kit/utils` |
| **App shell / chrome** | `internal/ui/layout` | `.../internal/ui/layout` |
| **Small composites** | `internal/ui/components` | `.../internal/ui/components` |
| **Page sections** | `internal/ui/blocks/<group>` | `.../internal/ui/blocks/<group>` |
| **UI + behavior** | `internal/ui/widgets` | (staging) |
| **Thin pages** | `internal/views` | compose layout + blocks only |
| **UI copy** | `internal/fixtures/locale` | not domain fixtures |

## Future destinations (do not invent new roots)

| Today | Later (shadcn-like / modules) |
| --- | --- |
| `internal/kit/ui` + `utils` | `github.com/fastygo/templ` (`ui/`, `utils/`) |
| `internal/ui/blocks/*` | `github.com/fastygo/blocks` or `fastygo add` copy |
| `internal/ui/widgets/*` | `github.com/fastygo/widgets` |
| `internal/ui/components/*` | CLI copy into consumer app |
| `internal/ui/layout` | **stays in the product app** |

## Placement rules

- New brick / variant → **codegen into kit** (never hand-edit `internal/kit/ui`).
- Reusable props-only piece used by ≥2 blocks → `internal/ui/components`.
- One screen section / organism → `internal/ui/blocks/<name>`.
- Needs HTMX/fetch/orchestration beyond markup → `internal/ui/widgets` (or keep in components until extracted).
- Document tags / app chrome → `internal/ui/layout` only.
- Domain/viewmodels stay out of kit; registry prefers props + fixtures for portability.

## Do not confuse names

- **`kit/ui`** = primitives (Button, Stack, …). Not the app registry.
- **`internal/ui`** = app registry (layout / components / blocks / widgets). Not atoms.
- Raw HTML policy → `.cursor/rules/templ-retag.mdc` + `retag.allow` in config.
